GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "D88E190CB3F1DC25"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{50FF1E2E72C17016}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "A British SBS Squadron has been tasked with conduting a raid onto Bebble Island, due north of the main Falkland island."\
     "They've been tasked with destroying Argentine rotary aircraft and various other objectives around the island in preperation for follow on attacks from the main friendly body in a few days."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EC80EE07EB0169AA}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "|PRELIMS|"\
     "DTL: 8th MAY 1982 0300H, Bebble Island, Falkland islands."\
     "Weather: Cloudy, light rain, light low level fog, sight lines up to 1km."\
     ""\
     "|LORE|"\
     "Operation Bebble - United kingdom, SBS, C-Squadron, 1st + 2nd Troop."\
     ""\
     "One of the first things the Agrentine Army did when making land fall on the Falkland islands was capture Bebble Island."\
     "Situated on the north west of the falkland mainland, Bebble island was the closest location to Argentina within the Falklands that provided airfields, ports, supplies, all within a defendable location. It was a key target for the invaders."\
     "The British forces garrisoning Bebble island stood no chance. Completely out numbered 10-1, out gunned, and with no other options, the British garrison surrendered and were taken as POWs."\
     "The Falkland islands were home to British civilians, some of who were part of military families living on the island. While the soldiers are now POWs, the island civilian populas has been kept to not only deter kinetic offensive actions from the British to retake the island, but to also help maintain the island facilities."\
     ""\
     "1 month into the invasion of the Falkland islands, the top brass have come up with a plan to conduct a shaping operation by the special boat service (SBS) in order to set the state for follow on forces to recapture the island."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{CC2BC782A0B79019}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "|PRELIMS|"\
     "DTL: 8th MAY 1982 0300H, Bebble Island, Falkland islands."\
     "Weather: Cloudy, light rain, light low level fog, sight lines up to 1km."\
     ""\
     "|LORE|"\
     "Operation Bebbled"\
     ""\
     "One of the first things the Agrentine Army did when making land fall on the Falkland islands was capture Bebble Island."\
     "Situated on the north west of the falkland mainland, Bebble island was the closest location to Argentina within the Falklands that provided airfields, ports, supplies, all within a defendable location. It was a key target for the invaders."\
     "The British forces garrisoning Bebble island stood no chance. Completely out numbered 10-1, out gunned, and with no other options, the British garrison surrendered and were taken as POWs."\
     "The Falkland islands were home to British civilians, some of who were part of military families living on the island. While the soldiers are now POWs, the island civilian populas has been kept to not only deter kinetic offensive actions from the British to retake the island, but to also help maintain the island facilities."\
     ""\
     "Now after securing the island, our company has gone into routine."\
     "Conducting security operations so that the airforce can work from the air base we have here."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{57DB3D73E6C203A4}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "We are the Special Boat Service, C-Squadron, 1st and 2nd troop."\
     "Our main body of 65x pax is located at our staging location GRID 023999"\
     "Our 4x pax recce team is located on the island at their harbour location GRID 032021"\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "• 1x medic in SHQ and THQ"\
     "• 1x Sharpshooter in each THQ"\
     "• SSM, TSG, SC, 2ICs have wirecutters."\
     ""\
     "- Recce do not have AT or explosive abilities."\
     "- No air assets."\
     "- No IDF assets."\
     ""\
     "|SERVICE AND SUPPORT|"\
     "• 14x boats at our staging area capable of holding 8x pax each."\
     "• Each section has 1x LAW rocket."\
     "• GPMG ammo is cross loaded to max supply of 850rnds per sec."\
     "• Sappers have 5x small and 1x large demo charge."\
     "• TSG are carrying an extra 3x small demo charges."\
     ""\
     "- No resupply."\
     "- No reinforcements."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C746C42265ED0E7F}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "We are a small group of 8x Argentine soldiers from the Batallón de Infantería de Marina at GRID 013023"\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "We don't have much in the way of equipment or many men within our group."\
     "As it's a patrol we're light on ammo and no AT.              "\
     "What we've got on us and in our UAZs is everything."\
     "Each patrol has their own vehicle."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{01496BEDBEFCDBFD}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "Enemy forces are expected to number 150+ on Bebble Island. A reinforced infantry company of Argentinians from the Batallón de Infantería de Marina."\
     "Primarly consisting of light infantry throughout the whole island, we should still expect light motorised vehicles such as UAZs, GAZ, transport and utility trucks."\
     "AAA has been sighted by the recce section and all accurate locations have been provide on your map."\
     ""\
     "The forces on the island do have airlift capabilites via MI8 helicopters which are armed with MGs and unguided rocket pods."\
     ""\
     "Both roaming and static patrols have been sighted around the island. Static sentries are located at expected locations such as guard houses, towers, coastal bunkers, and key locations."\
     "Roaming patrols have been seen along perimeters and within key locations, including also no set pattern random patrols outside of installations within woodblocks, along roads, coast lines, and so forth."\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "• Good supply of ammo and equipment."\
     "• Able to maneuver rapidly with little detection - Full freedom of movement on the island."\
     "• High levels of security throughout the island."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{50E2AEC882D5153E}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "Enemy forces are the United Kingdom, located south east of us by 23mi/37km."\
     ""\
     "One current issue we're having is PID."\
     "The British look very familar to us in terms of uniforms and equipment."\
     "We should be mindful of this."\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "A highly motivated and well equip force."\
     "Equip with weaponry such as the FAL, FN MAG, and Hipower pistols which we also use."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C160D7581CF339F5}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "|MISSION STATEMENT|"\
     "C-Squadron is to conduct an early morning RAID onto Bebble Island IOT DESTROY equipment and DISRUPT enemy operations."\
     ""\
     "|OBJECTIVES|"\
     "Primary:"\
     "- DESTROY all rotary wing aircraft on the island so that the Argentine airlift capability is non-existent, then extract back to our staging area. Aircraft confirmed to be within AOI GOLD."\
     ""\
     "Optional:"\
     "- LOCATE and kill the island commander to disrupt operations."\
     "- LOCATE, COLLECT, and SECURE any intel you might potentially find back to our staging area."\
     "- LOCATE and DESTROY the ammo storage facility."\
     "- DESTROY the fuel storage silos located at objective cat."\
     "- DESTROY the radio tower at objective dog to hinder communications."\
     "- DESTROY several AAA pieces around the island to clear the skies."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4AEB82713CF72261}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "|MISSION STATEMENT|"\
     "Our group's mission for tonight is to conduct a routine PATROL around the island in order to potentially disrupt covert enemy infiltration opertions."\
     ""\
     "|EXECUTION|"\
     "• Patrols should not be static for any more then a few minutes unless in contact, sighting, relocation, medical, or other appropriate reason."\
     "• Patrols should not group up."\
     "• Patrols should be assigned their own patrol areas."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A506B3B5E83580F9}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Execution"
     m_sContent "|CONCEPT OF EXECUTION|"\
     "The helicopters on the island may be scrambled if our cover is blown early. It is paramount to operational sucess that these helicopters CANNOT be let to leave at all costs. "\
     "Remaining covert for as long as we can is crucial and will require a coordinated effort on timings and movements from all callsigns through effective communication."\
     ""\
     "Regardless of how many optional objectives the boss wants to do, the primary objective must ALWAYS be the main focus."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{68322264C1BF4C6F}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "COMSIG"
     m_sContent "|CHANNELS|"\
     "N/A"\
     ""\
     "|CALLSIGNS|"\
     "1st patrol - Aktiv-1"\
     "2nd patrol - Aktiv-2"\
     "3rd patrol - Aktiv-3"\
     "4th patrol - Aktiv-4"\
     ""\
     "|PYROTECHNICS|"\
     "White smoke/flare - Maneuvers/illumination"\
     "Green smoke/flare - Friendly location"\
     "Red smoke/flare - Enemy location"\
     "Yellow - Spare"\
     ""\
     "|OTHER|"\
     "Challenge: Whiskey"\
     "Password: Weston"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{50EA72E6E907DCC2}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "COMSIG"
     m_sContent "|CHANNELS|"\
     "ALL CALLSIGNS - 48hz | Fallback net - 46.2hz or OC's discretion."\
     ""\
     "|CALLSIGNS|"\
     "Recce: 38A"\
     "SHQ - 30"\
     ""\
     "1st Troop:"\
     "THQ - 31"\
     "1 Sec - 31A"\
     "2 Sec - 31B"\
     "3 sec - 31C"\
     "4 sec - 31D"\
     ""\
     "2nd Troop:"\
     "THQ - 32"\
     "1 Sec - 32A"\
     "2 Sec - 32B"\
     "3 sec - 32C"\
     "4 sec - 32D"\
     "(Troop commanders talk down, Signallers talk up - Signaller required if SHQ and/or other troop is slotted.)"\
     ""\
     "|PYROTECHNICS|"\
     "White smoke/flare - Maneuvers/illumination"\
     "Green smoke/flare - Friendly location"\
     "Red smoke/flare - Enemy location"\
     "Yellow - Spare"\
     ""\
     "|OTHER|"\
     "Challenge: Sunrise"\
     "Password: Cherry"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{CDCAC0989AC2E976}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "|END CONDITIONS|"\
     "BLUFOR"\
     "- Total victory: Complete ALL objectives and extracted with 30% of current alive force."\
     "- Major victory: Completed the primary objective, at least 4/6 optional objectives and extracted with 30% of current alive force."\
     "- Regular victory: Completed the primary objective, at least 2/6 optional objectives, and extracted with 30% of current alive force."\
     "- Minor victory: Completed the primary objective and extracted with 30% of current alive force."\
     ""\
     "OPFOR"\
     "- Kill 85% of BLUFOR"\
     ""\
     "|MISC|"\
     "RATIO: 8.6:1"\
     "- Timelimit: None"\
     "- Setup timer: None"\
     "- Respawns: None"\
     "- AO limits: None"\
     ""\
     "This mission can be influenced by a GM/zeus at any time."\
     "GM's have a max of 40x infantry pax, 3x soft skinned armed vehicles from the Agentine faction."\
     "The GM/Zeus should use their own reasonable discretion when it comes to spawning and placement of units."\
     ""\
     "Made by TheLocalPub. "\
     "This is a remake of one of my Arma 3 missions \"Bebble Island Raid\""
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
